              %em Review of Lattice Supersymmetry and Gauge-Gravity Duality
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1509.01440"}> arXiv:1509.01440
              )
          %p
            Using the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-compactification"} KK-compactification
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D4+N%3D4+super+Yang-Mills+theory"} D=4 N=4 super Yang-Mills theory
            to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/BMN+matrix+model"} BMN matrix model
            for
            = succeed "-computations" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/lattice+gauge+theory"} lattice gauge theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D4+N%3D4+SYM"} D=4 N=4 SYM
            and for numerical checks of the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/AdS-CFT+correspondence"} AdS-CFT correspondence
          %ul
            %li#HIKNT13
              Masazumi Honda,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Goro+Ishiki"} Goro Ishiki
              = succeed "," do
                %em Direct test of the AdS/CFT correspondence by Monte Carlo studies of N=4 super Yang-Mills theory
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1308.3525"} arXiv:1308.3525
          %h3#on_single_trace_operators On single trace operators
          %p
            The correspondence of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/single+trace+operators"} single trace operators
            to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/superstring"} superstring
            excitations under the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/AdS-CFT+correspondence"} AdS-CFT correspondence
            originates with these articles:
          %ul
            %li#Polyakov02
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexander+Polyakov"}> Alexander Polyakov
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Gauge Fields and Space-Time
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0110196"} arXiv:hep-th/0110196
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/S0217751X02013071"} doi:10.1142/S0217751X02013071
            %li#BerensteinMaldacenaNastase02
