                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SYK-model"} SYK-model
                as the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/AdS-CFT"} AdS/CFT dual
                of
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/JT-gravity"} JT-gravity
                in
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nearly+AdS2%2FCFT1"} nearly AdS2/CFT1
                and
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/AdS-CFT+in+condensed+matter+physics"} AdS-CFT in condensed matter physics
              %p Original articles:
              %ul
                %li#MaldacenaStanford16
                  %p
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Juan+Maldacena"}> Juan Maldacena
